sequenceDiagram
    participant Author
    participant DesignCmd as commands/design.md
    participant ArchSkill as skills/architecture (Design Mode)
    participant Goal as docs/architecture/designs/<name>/goal.json
    participant Intent as docs/architecture/designs/<name>/intent.json
    participant ADR as docs/architecture/adr/ADR-NNNN-<slug>.md
    participant Implement as cobuilder-implement skills/implement
    participant VerifyGate as scripts/verify_gate.py

    Author->>DesignCmd: /cobuilder-architect:design
    DesignCmd->>ArchSkill: Invoke architecture skill in Design Mode
    ArchSkill->>Author: Interview about the change
    Author-->>ArchSkill: Answers, options, tradeoffs
    ArchSkill->>ArchSkill: Explore options, challenge the approach
    ArchSkill->>Goal: Write planned epics
    ArchSkill->>Intent: Write captured intent
    ArchSkill->>ADR: Draft proposed ADR

    Note over Goal,ADR: Design stays off the timeline until generate mode files it under a real PR number

    Author->>Implement: /cobuilder-implement:implement runs an epic from goal.json
    Implement->>Implement: Slice the epic (Gate 4a, 04-slices.md)
    Implement->>Implement: Write technical solution design (Gate 4b, required when an epic has more than one slice)
    Implement->>Implement: Run blind rubrics (Gate 4c)
    Implement->>VerifyGate: Check gates 4a, 4b, 4c for the plan directory
    VerifyGate->>Goal: Read epics and slice counts
    VerifyGate-->>Implement: Exit non-zero if any gate is pending
    Implement-->>Author: Gate status per epic
